ing asset using the Curve protocol."},"withdrawToVault(uint256)":{"notice":"Withdraws an underlying asset from the strategy to the vault in the specified amount by asking the yCRV vault for yCRV (currently all of it), and then removing imbalanced liquidity from the Curve protocol. The rest is deposited back to the yCRV vault. If the amount requested cannot be obtained, the method will get as much as we have."},"yTokenValueFromUnderlying(uint256)":{"notice":"Returns the value of the underlying token in yToken"},"yTokenValueFromYCrv(uint256)":{"notice":"Returns the value of yCRV in underlying token accounting for slippage and fees."}},"notice":"Adds the mainnet addresses to the CRVStrategyStable"}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"CRVStrategyStableMainnet.sol":"CRVStrategyStableMainnet"},"evmVersion":"istanbul","libraries":{},"optimizer":{"enabled":true,"runs":150},"remappings":[]},"sources":{"CRVStrategyStableMainnet.sol":{"keccak256":"0x4fcc7b9cfc98cafb30caa3fb0e35b1733f9d3ee75133b5cb21b848d9cbef4c32","urls":["bzz-raw://d89ebb71c2053758aeaa4564a37c1790ccbbf9c111b89d07b485ceaac4ce2df8","dweb:/ipfs/QmcHk9ACD9Mw3Nq9N4Ad8s6G37QHbxMb46UhSPavWyreGs"]}},"version":1}